What Latch changed in packages/core:
  - Vault.sync() can be called only inside a lock.
  - Vault.lock() clears the reserve slots when the lock exits.
  - The transient-storage layer has two backends behind one interface: EIP-1153, and a
    storage backend for chains without it (src/libraries/transient).

